   "rule": "the range's low end: the knee's late-stance speed follows the roll's rate, and 0.40 rad by lift-off takes the knee to 0.98-0.99 of its speed limit at the nominal walk (V3T: 0.40 rad at 4.5 rad/s and 290 rad/s^2)"
